        "LocalizationKey": "Herbs_And_Fungi_MustardSeeds_CardDescription",
        "DefaultText": "A handful of small, hot wild mustard seeds. Not food on their own: drag them onto a plateable food to season it with a sharp, pungent bite. A handful seasons two plates."
    },
    "CardHelpSection": {
        "ParentObjectID": "herbs_fungi_mustard_seeds",
