        "DefaultText": "<b>Season:</b> Summer and autumn, on the Highland Meadow and the Foraging Path.\n\n<b>Uses:</b> Drag the seeds onto a plateable food (cooked meat, fish, eggs and the like) to season it, pungent with a bitter edge. Each drag uses up one of its two pinches."
    },
